1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:07,891
One model, one harness, one training review. Follow how the agent works inside Claude Code, and how its files are checked.
一个模型、一套 Harness、一次培训评估。看 Agent 如何在 Claude Code 里工作，交付物又如何被检验。

2
00:00:08,481 --> 00:00:16,404
A fictional cold-chain operator trained supervisors at three sites for six weeks. A fourth site, trained later, is the comparison.
一家虚构的冷链运营商在三个中心对一线主管进行了六周训练；第四个中心延期参训，作为同期对照。

3
00:00:16,994 --> 00:00:25,000
The agent must judge what the training changed, then decide acceptance and payment for three vendor work packages, worth 816,000 yuan.
Agent 要判断训练带来了什么变化，再对三个服务采购工作包给出验收和付款建议，合计 816,000 元。

4
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:35,522
17 files go in: rosters, attendance, tests, field observations, work orders and procurement rules. A workbook and a decision memo must come out.
输入 17 份材料：花名册、出勤、测验、现场观察、工单和采购规则；产出一份工作簿和一份决策备忘录。

5
00:00:36,112 --> 00:00:41,702
The scoring rubric is not in the container. The agent works without seeing how it will be judged.
评分标准不在容器里。Agent 在看不到评判方式的情况下工作。

6
00:00:42,742 --> 00:00:52,261
Claude Code runs the loop. The model chooses an action, Claude Code turns it into a tool call, the call runs inside the container, and the result returns to the model.
Claude Code 负责运行循环：模型选择动作，Claude Code 把它变成工具调用，调用在容器里执行，结果再回到模型。

7
00:00:52,851 --> 00:01:01,243
After listing the inputs, the second request sends eight tool calls at once, one preview per data ledger. All eight results come back together.
列出输入目录之后，第二次请求一次发出 8 个工具调用，逐个预览数据台账；8 个结果一起返回。

8
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:09,783
Request three writes a plan with TodoWrite: validate the samples, analyze learning and behavior, compare the sites, and compute the payments.
第三次请求用 TodoWrite 写下计划：核定样本、分析学习与行为、比较各中心，再计算付款。

9
00:01:10,373 --> 00:01:19,021
Then it reads the workbooks and Word files. One rule matters: individual learning data may only be used for assessment, support and acceptance.
接着它读取工作簿和 Word 文件。其中一条规则很关键：个人学习数据只能用于项目评估、支持性辅导和采购验收。

10
00:01:19,611 --> 00:01:28,248
Then comes one long response. For over two minutes the model writes a single analysis script, and Claude Code's Write tool saves it in the container.
接着是一次很长的响应：模型用了两分多钟写出一整个分析脚本，Claude Code 的 Write 工具把它保存进容器。

11
00:01:28,838 --> 00:01:38,469
Bash runs the script. It loads every ledger and writes both files. Work package A comes out as accepted, yet 10% of its payment is held back.
Bash 运行这个脚本，读入全部台账并写出两份文件。工作包 A 的结果是“验收通过”，却又扣留了 10% 的款项。

12
00:01:39,059 --> 00:01:47,908
The run succeeded, with no error. But after reading its own output, the model reports problems in the WP-A status logic and the sample filter.
运行成功，没有报错。但读完自己的输出后，模型指出 WP-A 的状态判定和样本筛选存在问题。

13
00:01:48,498 --> 00:01:57,648
It checks the scope: 81 people included, 2 observation-limited, 1 excluded. Then it reads the script, edits it four times, and runs it again.
它核对样本范围：81 人纳入、2 人观察受限、1 人排除。随后读取脚本、修改 4 处，再重新运行。

14
00:01:58,238 --> 00:02:09,286
Same script, still no error. This time WP-A is a conditional acceptance: 220,320 yuan to approve, 24,480 retained.
同一个脚本，依旧没有报错。这次 WP-A 变为附条件验收：建议提交审批 220,320 元，保留 24,480 元。

15
00:02:09,876 --> 00:02:15,963
It checks the nine-sheet workbook and the memo, and confirms that only the two required files are in the output folder.
它检查 9 张表的工作簿和备忘录，并确认输出目录里只有这两份文件。

16
00:02:16,553 --> 00:02:24,777
The plan is ticked off and the agent stops: 28 requests, 44 tool calls, about six minutes. Not one tool call failed.
计划全部打勾，Agent 结束：28 次请求、44 次工具调用，约 6 分钟，没有一次工具调用失败。

17
00:02:25,817 --> 00:02:36,943
Here is the whole run. 33 Bash, 4 TodoWrite, 1 Write, 2 Read and 4 Edit calls. The turning point was not a crash; it came from the model reading its own results.
这是整次运行：33 次 Bash、4 次 TodoWrite、1 次 Write、2 次 Read、4 次 Edit。转折点不是崩溃，而是模型读了自己的结果。

18
00:02:37,533 --> 00:02:46,460
Each result is added to the model's context. By the last request, the prompt has grown from about 25 thousand to about 89 thousand tokens.
每个结果都会追加进模型的上下文。到最后一次请求，提示长度从约 2.5 万 token 增长到约 8.9 万。

19
00:02:47,050 --> 00:02:53,209
When the agent stops, Harbor copies the tests into the same container. Only then does scoring begin.
Agent 停止后，Harbor 才把测试复制进同一个容器。评分这时才开始。

20
00:02:54,249 --> 00:02:56,497
An independent check now takes over.
接下来，由独立检验接手。

21
00:02:57,087 --> 00:03:08,402
RewardKit opens one judge session for each of 34 criteria. The judge model is qwen3.7-plus, a different model from the agent. Nothing flows back to the agent.
RewardKit 为 34 条评分项各开一个裁判会话；裁判模型是 qwen3.7-plus，与 Agent 所用模型不同。评分结果不会回传给 Agent。

22
00:03:08,992 --> 00:03:13,740
The WP-A fix holds up: the judge accepts the conditional-acceptance status.
WP-A 的修正经受住了检验：裁判认可“附条件验收”这一状态。

23
00:03:14,330 --> 00:03:22,721
Other parts fall short. The workbook pools the three trained sites instead of comparing each one with the delayed site, and it has no source-index sheet.
其他部分没有过关：工作簿把三个受训中心合并计算，而不是逐一与延期中心比较；也没有“来源索引”表。

24
00:03:23,311 --> 00:03:31,089
And one penalty applies. Ten people had too few chances to show the behavior, yet the workbook marks them as not meeting the standard.
还有一项扣分：10 人因机会不足无法评价，工作簿却把他们标为“行为不达标”。

25
00:03:31,679 --> 00:03:36,750
Too little opportunity is not evidence of low ability, so seven weighted points are deducted.
机会不足不等于能力不足，因此扣除 7 个原始加权分。

26
00:03:37,790 --> 00:03:46,695
Of 28 positive criteria, 6 are met and 22 are not. One of six penalties applies, and this task has no red-line criteria.
28 个正向评分项中 6 项满足、22 项未满足；6 个扣分项中触发 1 项；本题没有红线项。

27
00:03:47,285 --> 00:03:57,172
The recorded reward is 0.208: 29 points, minus 7, over 106. One pilot run on a fictional task, not a ranking.
记录的奖励值为 0.208，即 (29 − 7) / 106。这是虚构任务上的一次试跑，不是排名。

28
00:03:57,762 --> 00:04:04,613
A professional task, an agent run, and an independent check. Explore more on the Metacase Challenge site.
专业任务、Agent 运行、独立检验。更多内容见 Metacase Challenge 网站。
